id: spiritual-cloning
name: Spiritual Cloning
uaType: both
prerequisite: Spirit Control
tpCost: 15
type: standard
actionCost: 3
kiCostPerTier: 10
# Up to 4 Duplicate Minions, outside your maximum - made as any Duplicate is, from the Settings tab - and the Tier of Power 1 lower
# for you and them while they stand: the table's.
source: Spirit Control
description: >
  Up to 4 Duplicate Minions; you and they a Tier of Power lower (Combat Rolls -2 at Tier 1).
text: >
  Spiritual Cloning: You split into several copies of yourself created from your own energy.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Spirit Control
  –TP Cost: 15
  –KP Cost: 10(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 3 Actions
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Create up to 4 Duplicate Minions (these Minions do not count towards your maximum number of Minions). Reduce the Tier of Power of you and any Duplicate Minions created through Spiritual Cloning by 1 (if already Tier of Power 1, reduce your/their Combat Rolls by 2 instead).
  If you fail a Steadfast Check while you have Duplicate Minion(s) created by Spiritual Cloning, those Minions are Defeated.
  As an Instant Maneuver during your turn, you can erase all of your Duplicate Minions created by this Unique Ability.
